    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/68202663ba98670d20ef66e5c0889929-Screenshot 2026-06-02 114107.png",
    "display_name": "Defeat the Boss",
    "bubble_choice_description": "The loop keeps running and spawning enemies even when the boss is defeated!",
    "long_instructions": "### Debug a Game Loop\r\n\r\nYou're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for a boss fight. The AI started the battle loop but left part of the logic unfinished.\r\n\r\nThe boss starts with 100 HP. Each round:\r\n\r\n* An enemy spawns and attacks the player.\r\n* The player sends fireballs at the boss.\r\n* The boss loses HP.\r\n\r\nThe battle should continue until the boss's HP reaches 0 or below. Then the game should stop the loop and show that the boss was defeated.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:**\r\n\r\n1. Run the code and observe what happens.\r\n2. Review the loop and identify what information is missing for the game to know when the battle is over.\r\n3. Ask the AI Tutor to suggest code that completes the loop.\r\n4. Use the Debugging Checklist to evaluate the AI's suggestion:\r\n\r\n   * Does the code check the boss's HP each round?\r\n   * Does it update the `bossDefeated` variable when the boss's HP reaches 0 or below?\r\n   * Will the loop stop once the boss is defeated?\r\n5. Update the code as needed and test your solution.\r\n6. Confirm that the game ends when the boss's HP reaches 0 or below and displays the result.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n::: details [**🔎 Show me how**]\r\n*Drag out the instructions panel to enlarge the image.*\r\n![](https://images.code.org/7f748aa31a8ed85e6ab0b5e2dd9c67b4-image-1781203080365.png)\r\n:::\r\n",
    "name_suffix": "_pl"
  },
